parameters.help_en:
The key-value pair data of the ConfigMap in JSON format. The format is as follows:

{"Data":"{\"k1\":\"v1\", \"k2\":\"v2\"}"}

k represents the key, and v represents the value. For more information about ConfigMaps, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/171326.html

parameters.help_zh:
ConfigMap键值对数据，JSON格式。格式如下：

{"Data":"{\"k1\":\"v1\", \"k2\":\"v2\"}"}

k表示键，v表示值。关于配置项的更多信息，请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/171326.html
